### 2. Admin Console UI (4 Interactive Terminals)
Upgraded `apps/admin/src/app/page.tsx` with **4 Dedicated Terminal Tabs**:

1. **`[ ⚙️ Engine (Count) ]`**:
   - Live GPS Ingestion Telemetry (`[GEO-MATCH]`)
   - HMM Route Snapping (`[MAP-MATCH]`)
   - Geocoder & Route Seeding (`[GEOCODER-SEEDER]`)
   - New Bus Discovery (`[NEW-BUS-DISCOVERY]`)

2. **`[ 🛡️ Admin (Count) ]`**:
   - Admin Authentication & Sessions (`[AUTH]`)
   - Depot Manager Scheduler Logs (`[SCHEDULER]`)
   - Operational Alerts & Cleanup (`[DEPOT-CLEANUP]`)

3. **`[ 📱 Web-App (Count) ]`**:
   - Passenger activity events & app latencies (`[WEB-PORTAL]`, `[ANDROID]`, `[IOS]`)

4. **`[ 🌐 Gateway (Count) ]`**:
   - Express HTTP Requests, Status Codes (`200 OK`, `404 Not Found`, `500 Error`), and Query execution latencies in ms (`[HTTP-ROUTER]`).

